Day 19 -Adanced Monitoring Logging and security 
🔹Ansible - Setup Promethus for Monitoring
- name: Install Prometheus for Monitoring
  hots: all
  become: yes
  tasks:
    - name: Install Prometheus dependencies
      yum :
        - Prometheus
        - prometheus-node-exporter
      state: present
  - name: Start Prometheus service
    service:
       name: prometheus 
      state: started
      enable: yes
